WEBVTT

00:00:10.218 --> 00:00:12.762
The air suddenly got tense

00:00:13.304 --> 00:00:14.514
Who is he?

00:00:14.973 --> 00:00:17.017
So small

00:00:17.392 --> 00:00:19.227
What the hell?!

00:00:19.602 --> 00:00:21.271
Hao-sama…

00:00:21.479 --> 00:00:23.565
Huh? Ah sorry

00:00:23.898 --> 00:00:26.818
It's all right, Opacho
is still the smallest

00:00:26.943 --> 00:00:29.195
Opacho small!

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:31.740
Didn't that kid just say Hao?

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:33.408
No, it can't be...

00:00:33.908 --> 00:00:36.619
You showed up sooner than we expected...

00:00:36.911 --> 00:00:38.455
Asakura Hao

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:40.972
Chō-Senjiryakketsu

00:00:40.997 --> 00:00:44.127
Is it that much of a problem
when I give this to Yoh?

00:00:44.419 --> 00:00:45.670
Anna-sama, that's...

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:50.425
Oh, you've figured out that
much already? I'm impressed

00:00:51.468 --> 00:00:52.927
I wanted to meet you, Anna

00:00:54.637 --> 00:00:59.599
The future bride of the Asakura,
who defeated my Shikigami familiars

00:02:31.025 --> 00:02:32.110
Wanted to meet..?

00:02:32.235 --> 00:02:33.653
He knows who she is?!

00:02:34.279 --> 00:02:35.972
It's an honor

00:02:35.997 --> 00:02:38.157
I take it you're not after revenge?

00:02:38.408 --> 00:02:42.245
Haha, do I look like
such a small man to you?

00:02:42.745 --> 00:02:45.123
I have great respect for you

00:02:45.582 --> 00:02:49.961
And I want Yoh to have the
Chō-Senjiryakketsu as soon as possible.

00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:52.547
What do you mean?

00:02:53.339 --> 00:02:56.426
To be frank, Yoh
is still too weak.

00:02:56.926 --> 00:03:00.180
He'll never survive the
battle that awaits him.

00:03:01.181 --> 00:03:08.146
But if he masters the Chō-Senjiryakketsu,
he'll become unimaginably more powerful

00:03:09.147 --> 00:03:14.277
I want Yoh to get stronger
quickly so that he can assist me.

00:03:15.570 --> 00:03:17.322
Manta-sama who is he?

00:03:17.655 --> 00:03:19.365
I'll explain later

00:03:20.033 --> 00:03:21.951
He will never assist you

00:03:22.452 --> 00:03:24.996
Tell me where Yoh is

00:03:27.999 --> 00:03:32.712
Excellent, the bride of an
Asakura must have courage

00:03:33.504 --> 00:03:34.505
I approve

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:38.551
Yoh is inside the cave

00:03:39.344 --> 00:03:42.722
You'd better get the
Chō-Senjiryakketsu to him right away.

00:03:43.514 --> 00:03:48.102
Assisting me is something
he can also do later, Anna

00:03:48.436 --> 00:03:51.272
Look if you keep talking nonsense...

00:03:54.317 --> 00:03:55.735
Anna-sama...

00:03:55.860 --> 00:03:57.946
Her slap got blocked!

00:04:00.365 --> 00:04:02.075
Now I like you even more

00:04:02.742 --> 00:04:06.287
You're the perfect wife for the Shaman King.

00:04:07.956 --> 00:04:08.873
Not so fast

00:04:09.082 --> 00:04:11.834
I still have my left!

00:04:17.548 --> 00:04:19.759
Of course I'll be the Shaman King's wife

00:04:20.677 --> 00:04:22.512
Yoh's going to win

00:04:23.972 --> 00:04:26.599
Now let's go,Tamao, Manta

00:04:26.766 --> 00:04:27.308
Yes!

00:04:27.475 --> 00:04:28.643
Move fast!

00:04:29.894 --> 00:04:31.688
I like this feeling

00:04:32.021 --> 00:04:36.317
Very courageous, No one's
slapped me like that since my mother.

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:40.868
But I wouldn't say it didn't hurt

00:04:42.865 --> 00:04:45.118
I told you I'm sorry

00:04:46.035 --> 00:04:48.663
Don't worry about it, Amidamaru

00:04:48.712 --> 00:04:50.915
You're the one who should be moping

00:04:51.124 --> 00:04:52.834
This is the second time

00:04:53.042 --> 00:04:55.712
Well, what's done is done

00:04:56.170 --> 00:04:59.465
Is it okay? We're about
to enter the patch village

00:04:59.882 --> 00:05:03.261
That's a problem, what're you going to do, Ren.

00:05:03.553 --> 00:05:04.846
Why are you asking me?

00:05:05.405 --> 00:05:09.407
Young master, It is poison for your
body and soul to get so aggravated.

00:05:09.432 --> 00:05:12.186
I have no intention of
wasting any more time.

00:05:12.687 --> 00:05:14.314
Don't be like that, Ren

00:05:14.814 --> 00:05:17.066
We still have plenty of time

00:05:17.817 --> 00:05:19.652
I'm not going back to town either.

00:05:21.154 --> 00:05:23.531
I've come a long way to defeat Hao

00:05:24.157 --> 00:05:28.786
You lost your sword because
you helped one of Hao's minions.

00:05:29.412 --> 00:05:30.621
Hey, Lyserg

00:05:31.039 --> 00:05:32.832
Are you still upset about that?

00:05:33.583 --> 00:05:34.500
but...

00:05:34.917 --> 00:05:36.085
Horohoro

00:05:36.544 --> 00:05:38.421
How's he doing

00:05:38.963 --> 00:05:40.006
He's in bad shape

00:05:40.371 --> 00:05:43.738
Kororo's cold breath can't
keep him alive for long.

00:05:44.093 --> 00:05:45.261
Is that so...

00:05:45.762 --> 00:05:48.264
Then we'll take him with us

00:05:48.639 --> 00:05:50.141
Wait a second, Yoh-kun...

00:05:50.516 --> 00:05:53.269
The Patch village is close, right?

00:05:53.644 --> 00:05:55.438
Once we get there, I'm sure they can help

00:05:55.813 --> 00:05:56.773
But still...

00:05:56.973 --> 00:05:58.535
Is that okay, Amidamaru?

00:05:58.900 --> 00:06:02.278
Once we're there we'll summon
Mosuke to repair Harusame.

00:06:02.612 --> 00:06:04.697
You mean it?

00:06:06.783 --> 00:06:10.244
The mood suddenly went
from gloomy to cheerful.

00:06:11.079 --> 00:06:14.499
This is one of Yoh-kun's gifts

00:06:16.459 --> 00:06:18.211
And it scares me

00:06:18.878 --> 00:06:21.923
I'm afraid I'll lose
myself if I'm not careful

00:06:24.092 --> 00:06:25.384
Are you okay, Ryu?

00:06:25.802 --> 00:06:26.969
Piece of cake!

00:06:27.261 --> 00:06:29.472
I have above average tenacity

00:06:29.972 --> 00:06:34.018
We've made it this far, but
we haven't figured out anything.

00:06:34.644 --> 00:06:35.394
Meaning?

00:06:35.770 --> 00:06:38.439
We went to America in the Patch jumbo jet

00:06:38.981 --> 00:06:42.735
Meeting Lilirara
and the Seminoa warriors

00:06:43.236 --> 00:06:46.030
Hao and the X-Laws

00:06:47.406 --> 00:06:49.700
I'm feeling smaller than usual

00:06:51.452 --> 00:06:52.286
You're right

00:06:54.288 --> 00:06:57.291
Yeah, we're so small

00:06:58.793 --> 00:07:01.838
Huh? Did I say something wrong?

00:07:02.213 --> 00:07:05.258
No I sense something strange again

00:07:05.883 --> 00:07:08.928
Wait, you feel it too?

00:07:09.345 --> 00:07:11.597
Then I'm not imagining it

00:07:12.348 --> 00:07:15.143
It's as though someone were calling me

00:07:16.769 --> 00:07:19.689
Your souls were guided here

00:07:20.064 --> 00:07:21.816
Huh? You've noticed it too?

00:07:22.316 --> 00:07:23.276
Put me down

00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:25.778
I'm okay now

00:07:27.029 --> 00:07:29.365
You're not okay at all

00:07:29.782 --> 00:07:31.159
You'll die

00:07:31.617 --> 00:07:34.370
Sorry, but I don't want your charity

00:07:35.246 --> 00:07:38.708
So I'll repay you for saving me

00:07:40.126 --> 00:07:45.006
This is the true road open
only to the chosen Shamans

00:07:45.506 --> 00:07:47.758
The true road?

00:07:48.134 --> 00:07:50.344
Yes, there's a Patch village here

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:54.348
But your true destination is that place.

00:07:54.939 --> 00:07:59.377
The Patch are just the guardians that
protect it generation after generation

00:07:59.937 --> 00:08:02.482
The celestial holy ground

00:08:06.319 --> 00:08:08.237
Tell us what this celestial holy ground is!

00:08:09.405 --> 00:08:12.742
That's all I will tell you

00:08:12.867 --> 00:08:14.869
You..!
Don't force him, Ren

00:08:15.161 --> 00:08:16.078
But...

00:08:16.454 --> 00:08:19.290
So what are you going to do now?

00:08:19.874 --> 00:08:22.001
I'll make it there on my own

00:08:22.543 --> 00:08:26.130
I'm the toughest of Hao's minions

00:08:27.256 --> 00:08:29.800
Big guy Bill is not that easy to...

00:08:30.968 --> 00:08:32.178
kill...

00:08:35.681 --> 00:08:36.182
Yoh

00:08:36.682 --> 00:08:37.975
Yeah

00:08:39.644 --> 00:08:43.272
All we can do is prepare
for the worst and go forward

00:08:45.608 --> 00:08:50.112
The time has come for them to
learn the meaning of this journey

00:08:50.558 --> 00:08:52.409
About the celestial holy ground

00:08:52.698 --> 00:08:55.826
About the place where
every soul reincarnates

00:08:56.744 --> 00:08:59.956
About the earth's 5.6
billion years of memory

00:09:00.748 --> 00:09:06.170
The supreme spirit ally that
only the Shaman King can obtain!

00:09:07.505 --> 00:09:12.468
The time has come for
the great spirit's blessing!

00:09:42.206 --> 00:09:44.792
(Leaf) What is it now...

00:09:47.962 --> 00:09:49.755
Where is everybody?

00:09:50.006 --> 00:09:51.257
You're finally awake

00:09:52.341 --> 00:09:53.384
Silva!

00:09:53.621 --> 00:09:58.519
This is the Patch village, the sacred
land where the great spirit is enshrined.

00:09:59.265 --> 00:10:01.017
You've come far, Yoh-kun

00:10:02.184 --> 00:10:03.936
Drink this to calm down first

00:10:04.979 --> 00:10:08.566
This fish and banana
soup is good after a vision

00:10:09.150 --> 00:10:10.901
Vision?

00:10:11.652 --> 00:10:12.695
Did you see it?

00:10:13.088 --> 00:10:16.580
The memory of the world that
sleeps deep within your heart

00:10:16.866 --> 00:10:17.658
What?

00:10:18.117 --> 00:10:20.161
Your confusion is only natural

00:10:20.828 --> 00:10:21.746
Look

00:10:22.496 --> 00:10:24.915
See what gave you the vision

00:10:27.585 --> 00:10:30.671
You received a blessing
from the Great Spirit

00:10:31.797 --> 00:10:34.133
W-What?

00:10:36.052 --> 00:10:40.973
Countless souls, infinitely connected...

00:10:41.682 --> 00:10:44.685
Is that what the Great Spirit is?

00:10:46.103 --> 00:10:47.104
It's happening again

00:10:47.563 --> 00:10:50.399
Something's entering my brain

00:10:51.108 --> 00:10:52.068
That's right!

00:10:52.568 --> 00:10:56.030
I saw that thing when
I came out of the cave

00:10:56.815 --> 00:11:00.088
You shouldn't stare directly
at it for too long at first

00:11:00.529 --> 00:11:02.732
If you do, you'll faint again

00:11:04.121 --> 00:11:07.792
The Great Spirit is the wellspring
of all the souls on earth...

00:11:07.817 --> 00:11:10.215
And the destiny to which they all return

00:11:10.878 --> 00:11:13.924
When a Shaman comes here and beholds it...

00:11:13.949 --> 00:11:17.875
The Great Spirit awakens the
memories sleeping inside his genes.

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:22.853
Depending on the environment and philosophy
that the Shaman grew up in, the visions vary.

00:11:23.474 --> 00:11:27.853
But some can't bear the impact of
the 5.6 billion years of memories...

00:11:28.312 --> 00:11:30.398
They never regain consciousness

00:11:30.815 --> 00:11:34.568
Hold on, this is going way too fast

00:11:34.756 --> 00:11:37.163
That's why I said you should calm down

00:11:38.239 --> 00:11:41.033
Hey, you're drinking my soup

00:11:42.493 --> 00:11:43.327
Anyway

00:11:44.120 --> 00:11:46.163
You were led here unharmed

00:11:46.872 --> 00:11:51.001
And you've shown us your soul's
capacity to accept the Great Spirit.

00:11:51.470 --> 00:11:55.133
You've successfully passed the
first trial of the main competition

00:11:55.381 --> 00:11:57.258
Seriously!

00:11:57.967 --> 00:12:01.053
That voice has got to be...

00:12:01.971 --> 00:12:05.307
Then I'm one step closer to my dream!

00:12:05.558 --> 00:12:06.767
I did it, Kalim!

00:12:07.268 --> 00:12:08.227
Horohoro!

00:12:08.644 --> 00:12:11.397
Yoh, you made it!

00:12:11.689 --> 00:12:14.650
Isn't it awesome?! The Great Spirit!

00:12:15.568 --> 00:12:17.236
But where are the others?

00:12:18.279 --> 00:12:21.907
When I found you all,
Lyserg was already gone

00:12:22.616 --> 00:12:26.287
If he's alive, his officiant
must have taken him.

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:27.997
"If he's alive"?!

00:12:28.497 --> 00:12:30.291
So what about the rest?

00:12:30.416 --> 00:12:32.835
Aren't you in charge of Ren and Ryu, too?!

00:12:35.670 --> 00:12:39.049
Where are you Lyserg?!

00:12:39.425 --> 00:12:40.134
Ryu?

00:12:41.594 --> 00:12:44.180
Oh, Horohoro and the boss

00:12:44.430 --> 00:12:49.101
Ryu-kun woke up early and I
gave him permission to walk around

00:12:49.268 --> 00:12:51.312
Say it!
Where is Ren?

00:12:51.812 --> 00:12:53.554
I must say he surprised me

00:12:53.843 --> 00:12:58.468
Instead of fainting, he was gazing at the
Great Spirit straight on when I got here

00:12:59.653 --> 00:13:00.946
Wonderful

00:13:01.322 --> 00:13:03.115
I want it, Bason

00:13:03.991 --> 00:13:05.326
Yes, Young master

00:13:08.496 --> 00:13:10.706
What a terrible dream...

00:13:11.624 --> 00:13:17.213
But until I defeat Hao, I can't die

00:13:20.257 --> 00:13:21.217
That day...

00:13:21.550 --> 00:13:24.637
I saw something I shouldn't have

00:13:25.596 --> 00:13:30.351
To seize the Great Spirit and
become the Shaman King...

00:13:31.310 --> 00:13:36.440
Might be something much bigger
and more terrible than I imagined.

00:13:48.786 --> 00:13:55.042
Until the rest of the competitors
arrive, we're supposed to rest up here.

00:13:56.085 --> 00:13:57.836
It's one big tourist trap

00:13:59.129 --> 00:14:00.923
Oh, it's a Patch strap!

00:14:01.298 --> 00:14:03.968
It says they look cool on your Oracle Bell!

00:14:05.636 --> 00:14:10.349
Checking out the souvenirs?
You must be sure of yourself, slacker

00:14:10.724 --> 00:14:12.393
Where have you been?!

00:14:12.643 --> 00:14:15.563
I've been assessing the enemy, of course

00:14:16.021 --> 00:14:18.399
Needless to say, I saw no worthy opponents

00:14:18.524 --> 00:14:20.734
Ren, this is amazing!

00:14:21.026 --> 00:14:22.236
A Patch doll!

00:14:23.404 --> 00:14:24.947
I like this doll a lot

00:14:27.116 --> 00:14:28.117
That voice...

00:14:29.076 --> 00:14:30.119
No way...

00:14:30.817 --> 00:14:37.710
As expected, you've got excellent taste! That
traditionally crafted silver Patch man is $380

00:14:38.752 --> 00:14:39.712
That's too much

00:14:43.632 --> 00:14:45.634
I'll give you 380 Yen

00:14:45.884 --> 00:14:46.802
Anna!

00:14:47.219 --> 00:14:49.388
Don't be so cheap!

00:14:50.806 --> 00:14:52.474
Yoh? What are you talking about

00:14:52.845 --> 00:14:55.436
It's just a key chain,
380 Yen is a fair price

00:14:55.603 --> 00:14:59.732
Think about the poor Patch craftsmen
who work hard to make these treasures!

00:15:00.441 --> 00:15:02.276
Boss, what're you doing here?

00:15:03.944 --> 00:15:05.571
I've come to make Yoh stronger

00:15:05.946 --> 00:15:06.739
What?

00:15:07.072 --> 00:15:10.451
I've got to make you really strong

00:15:11.243 --> 00:15:12.286
Otherwise...

00:15:14.121 --> 00:15:16.206
Someone else might take me...

00:15:17.249 --> 00:15:19.877
Oh, I'm sorry

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:22.546
What was that?

00:15:23.172 --> 00:15:26.467
I have a feeling something
terrible is gonna happen

00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:31.180
Looks like he's forgotten
all about your Harusame

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:32.973
Ha!

00:15:33.349 --> 00:15:37.811
Bringing your woman to the Shaman
Fight? Now that's just disrespectful

00:15:38.979 --> 00:15:41.690
You all seem to be on
good terms with each other.

00:15:42.066 --> 00:15:43.984
But will you qualify for the next round?

00:15:50.824 --> 00:15:52.242
Hey, don't ignore me!

00:15:52.368 --> 00:15:54.495
You gotta hear what I have to say!

00:15:54.620 --> 00:15:57.539
You realize the next event
is a tournament, right?!

00:15:59.500 --> 00:16:00.542
Tournament?

00:16:01.877 --> 00:16:03.377
Permanent

00:16:06.924 --> 00:16:08.967
Listen to me!

00:16:09.093 --> 00:16:10.844
I'm not kidding!

00:16:12.888 --> 00:16:15.015
If you've got something to say, say it fast

00:16:15.398 --> 00:16:17.530
Make another pun and I'll cut you

00:16:17.656 --> 00:16:19.228
I get it, it's no joke!

00:16:19.603 --> 00:16:22.231
I'm looking for teammates

00:16:22.564 --> 00:16:23.691
Teammates?

00:16:24.024 --> 00:16:28.946
Yeah, from here on out, it's
gonna be three against three.

00:16:29.321 --> 00:16:33.867
Everyone can form their own team, and if
you can't you'll be disqualified

00:16:34.493 --> 00:16:37.287
You guys don't seem
to have the right number

00:16:37.621 --> 00:16:39.999
So I'd thought I'd
join you, that's all.

00:16:40.791 --> 00:16:42.835
What is your name?

00:16:44.211 --> 00:16:46.171
Chocolove

00:16:46.755 --> 00:16:49.341
Oh man, he really stabbed me!

00:16:49.466 --> 00:16:51.552
Is that your real name?

00:16:52.094 --> 00:16:53.512
Of course it is!

00:16:54.930 --> 00:16:57.808
What the..? It's getting
noisier in the plaza

00:16:58.183 --> 00:17:02.354
Sheesh, you'd better let
me join you guys real quick.

00:17:02.813 --> 00:17:05.816
because the toughest
competitor just showed up

00:17:06.275 --> 00:17:08.694
The toughest competitor?

00:17:09.570 --> 00:17:12.614
Almost every Shaman in
the fight knows about him

00:17:13.115 --> 00:17:18.579
After all, he's lived over a thousand
years just to be Shaman King.

00:17:19.496 --> 00:17:24.334
With an army of loyal minions, and
unstoppable flame, I'm talking about...

00:17:25.878 --> 00:17:26.712
Hao

00:17:27.421 --> 00:17:32.092
His team's the favorite of the three forces

00:17:32.968 --> 00:17:34.970
The three forces?

00:17:35.763 --> 00:17:37.598
The three horses

00:17:38.891 --> 00:17:41.018
Explain yourself

00:17:41.435 --> 00:17:45.564
Look, there are three
organizations competing in this fight

00:17:46.648 --> 00:17:48.484
One of them is Hao's team

00:17:49.234 --> 00:17:52.529
The other two were created to oppose Hao's team...

00:17:52.654 --> 00:17:54.615
Gandhara and the X-Laws

00:17:55.157 --> 00:17:56.366
The X-Laws?

00:17:56.700 --> 00:17:59.328
Oh, you've heard of them?

00:18:00.078 --> 00:18:07.211
Then you probably know that the leaders of
the three forces are all God-class Shamans

00:18:08.462 --> 00:18:10.088
God-class?

00:18:11.048 --> 00:18:12.257
Camisole

00:18:13.509 --> 00:18:18.972
Basically, a regular Shaman would have to be
a fool to go up against a God-class Shaman

00:18:19.515 --> 00:18:24.603
Your only chance of making your dream come
true is to position yourself under them, right?

00:18:25.270 --> 00:18:26.647
What're you saying

00:18:27.397 --> 00:18:33.195
About 70% of the Shamans here
are already in one of the three forces

00:18:34.363 --> 00:18:37.574
That's why I'm looking for teammates

00:18:38.116 --> 00:18:40.077
How do you know all this?

00:18:40.744 --> 00:18:43.080
Because information is my weapon

00:18:43.956 --> 00:18:48.836
To succeed in life, the most important
thing is to get accurate information quickly

00:18:49.211 --> 00:18:49.795
What?

00:18:50.212 --> 00:18:54.424
Having information means knowing your enemy

00:18:55.300 --> 00:19:01.014
That's why I knew it was time for Hao to
show up, even though I didn't see myself

00:19:03.684 --> 00:19:04.852
Let me introduce...

00:19:05.310 --> 00:19:07.354
My guardian spirit, Mic the Jaguar

00:19:08.506 --> 00:19:12.709
With his nose and my talent, I'm
gonna be the worlds greatest comedian...

00:19:12.734 --> 00:19:16.655
The public's crying out
for one. That's my dream.

00:19:18.240 --> 00:19:19.032
Not a chance

00:19:19.366 --> 00:19:21.785
What is it, just say it in my face!

00:19:21.910 --> 00:19:22.995
Impossible

00:19:23.328 --> 00:19:24.204
Not a chance

00:19:25.914 --> 00:19:28.125
Hao's team and two other forces

00:19:29.084 --> 00:19:31.920
This is getting complicated

00:19:32.337 --> 00:19:33.755
What's wrong Anna?

00:19:33.964 --> 00:19:35.799
Do you think he can do it?

00:19:36.091 --> 00:19:38.677
He's too loud, I couldn't care less about him

00:19:40.179 --> 00:19:43.098
But could you care more?!

00:19:43.900 --> 00:19:45.350
You're just not funny

00:19:46.435 --> 00:19:47.936
You're in a bad mood

00:19:48.395 --> 00:19:50.856
I'm going back to the dormitory

00:19:51.773 --> 00:19:53.025
What's your plan?

00:19:53.317 --> 00:19:58.947
Hmm, if what Chocolove
says is true, then he can join us.

00:19:59.072 --> 00:20:02.034
Not again, can't you think for yourself?

00:20:02.201 --> 00:20:03.702
Oh yeah

00:20:04.328 --> 00:20:09.499
Counting Lyserg, there's five of us, we'll
eventually have to let someone join us

00:20:09.958 --> 00:20:13.712
Excellent, he can be on my team

00:20:14.338 --> 00:20:16.006
Your team?

00:20:16.418 --> 00:20:18.463
Isn't this a great opportunity?

00:20:18.488 --> 00:20:22.387
After all, we'll have to
face each other eventually

00:20:23.055 --> 00:20:28.560
So we may as well be on different teams,
we'll get it over with sooner that way

00:20:28.727 --> 00:20:30.854
What an attitude

00:20:31.271 --> 00:20:32.898
It doesn't really matter

00:20:33.315 --> 00:20:35.192
But what about the rest?

00:20:35.484 --> 00:20:39.905
You guys are gonna keep running
around looking for Lyserg, right?

00:20:40.572 --> 00:20:45.118
Sorry, but I'd rather not take that chance

00:20:46.036 --> 00:20:48.247
One of the two, I don't care who

00:20:49.081 --> 00:20:50.123
You decide

00:20:50.582 --> 00:20:53.835
You don't care who?! You jerk!

00:20:54.086 --> 00:20:57.047
I won't join you unless Lyserg is with me!

00:20:58.048 --> 00:20:59.549
Ryu...

00:21:00.509 --> 00:21:02.386
It's decided then

00:21:03.178 --> 00:21:07.391
Chocolove and Horohoro,
my team is established

00:21:07.891 --> 00:21:09.184
Established?

00:21:09.559 --> 00:21:13.689
Hold it! How come I have
to team up with a stranger!

00:21:13.855 --> 00:21:16.566
You're impossible, Ren!

00:21:17.546 --> 00:21:18.991
I don't care

00:21:19.278 --> 00:21:22.739
Just stay behind me with your mouths shut

00:21:24.157 --> 00:21:26.702
I can handle the fighting alone

00:21:27.869 --> 00:21:30.163
I'll see you when we get instructions

00:21:30.622 --> 00:21:32.749
Just don't run away

00:21:33.291 --> 00:21:35.544
Wow, he's gone

00:21:35.836 --> 00:21:37.462
What a jerk!

00:21:37.921 --> 00:21:39.548
It's all right

00:21:39.715 --> 00:21:42.551
I haven't seen Ren excited in a long time

00:21:42.926 --> 00:21:45.220
Ren's cute when he's like that

00:21:45.846 --> 00:21:46.722
Cute?

00:21:50.058 --> 00:21:51.685
He can do it alone?

00:21:52.227 --> 00:21:54.396
Well, he can't make me look stupid

00:21:54.938 --> 00:21:59.404
It looks like I'd better
show him my real power

00:21:59.429 --> 00:22:00.694
I'm gonna make him cry!

00:22:01.028 --> 00:22:04.781
Oh, Horohoro's excited too

00:22:06.450 --> 00:22:07.784
Chocolove, huh

00:22:08.368 --> 00:22:10.871
Seems like an okay guy

00:22:11.288 --> 00:22:14.295
Anyone who looks like
muscle punch, can't be all bad

00:22:15.625 --> 00:22:18.420
All right, gotta look for Lyserg!

00:22:18.628 --> 00:22:19.880
Ren is gonna cry!

00:22:20.422 --> 00:22:23.967
How'd you stay alive with those guys?

00:22:26.011 --> 00:22:28.013
I like the way they are

00:22:29.639 --> 00:22:33.310
Hearing Yoh-dono laugh
makes me feel better somehow

00:22:33.602 --> 00:22:36.688
Yeah, but he's definitely
forgotten about Harusame

00:22:38.565 --> 00:22:41.735
We're going to be busy

00:22:43.689 --> 00:22:47.579
No matter how many times I see
it, the Great Spirit stays amazing

00:22:48.033 --> 00:22:53.955
If Yoh-kun's father wasn't here, I don't
know what would've happened to me.

00:22:54.581 --> 00:22:58.460
But Mikihisa-sama has gone somewhere...

00:22:58.960 --> 00:23:02.756
And Anna-sama went looking for
Yoh-sama and hasn't come back

00:23:05.926 --> 00:23:08.720
What's with the melancholia?

00:23:08.845 --> 00:23:11.056
Are you gonna make your move or what?

00:23:11.348 --> 00:23:12.891
Come on, Ponchi and Conchi!

00:23:13.225 --> 00:23:15.477
Don't be rude to Yoh-sama's friend!

00:23:18.063 --> 00:23:20.899
I think I'll go look for them

00:23:24.027 --> 00:23:28.156
I'm no good with
girls one on one.

00:23:29.116 --> 00:23:32.744
A song?

00:23:32.869 --> 00:23:36.248
Along the highway, I
walked with you hand in hand

00:23:36.414 --> 00:23:37.999
Excited hearts...

00:23:38.291 --> 00:23:44.673
Our pulses beating so fast

00:23:47.634 --> 00:23:49.761
Next time: "Black Jaguar"
